@api = https://localhost:7001
@token = <admin-access-token>
@auditId = <audit-guid>
@actorUserId = <actor-user-guid>

### Audit list — paging, entity, action, actor ve tarih filtreleri
GET {{api}}/api/audit-logs?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20&entityName=User&action=Updated&userId={{actorUserId}}&createdFrom=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&createdTo=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z&sortDirection=Descending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Audit detail
GET {{api}}/api/audit-logs/{{auditId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Audit actor lookup — UI ad-soyad/e-posta seçimi için kullanır
GET {{api}}/api/audit-logs/actors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
